        <p>Majority for Newton 16 WARRINGTON LIBERAL CLUB V. WINNINGTON.</p>
        <p>On Saturday the members of the Warring,ten Liberal Club bowling team proceeded in Mr. Maginn's 'buses to Winnington, and then suffered defeat at the hands of the local club. After the match tea was partaken of at the Stanley Arms. Scores : WARRINGTON. WINNINGTON. Sankey Langley Critchley Albinson 7 Howard Bennion 5 Forster l5 Knowles 1 Starkey Warren T Locker Lowe Allen Mitchell 3 Whitby Hooper Taylor 8 Ur sworth Brown ll Buckley Charnock Williams l5 Hughes J Locker l5 Vernc,n Bennett Singles...ls6 Singles_ 216 Doubles 82 Doubles ll5</p>
