        <p>The Duke of Devonshire prissesses as an heirloom Claud Lorraine's " Bonk of Truth," said to be one of the rarest and most. valuable books in Europe. /t is, at any rate, worth six times as much as the tamons " nezarin Bible, the most co,tly honk in the British Museum. The late Duke refused twenty thomand pounds tor it.</p>
